type: ConsumeGenerator
name: "[#E2BAF5]Illuminaium []Ichor Reactor"
description: "Combines [#E2BAF5]illuminaium[], [#ff5959]swordium[], [#c2c2c2]ghostwalkerium []& cryofluid to generate power, creates [#E2BAF5]illuminaium []ichor as by-product, won't explode if the ichor's full."
details: '''
If the reactor explodes, it'll empower all units caught in the blast, [scarlet]enemies []included, be sure to protect it well, less you want a stronger [scarlet]enemy []unit attacking your base.
'''
